# Signing keys of the clean-machine new-user gate accounts (docs/RELEASE_GATE.md).
#
# release.yml publishes a version only when its evidence bundle's manifest is
# signed by one of these keys. Make a gate account's key once, in that
# account, with `scripts/release-gate/collect-evidence.sh --init-signer`
# (it lives in ~/.axocoatl-gate-signer, which resets never touch), and add
# the line it prints, as it prints it, in a reviewed commit:
#
#   ed25519 <base64 public key> axocoatl@<host> <short id>
#
# The gate Mac's key (an Apple M5 Pro, 48 GB), made on 2026-10-21:
ed25519 O668TTUWxJS9WgH8y9ji7F4uVzse9zeQN5nH/aYB3qs= axocoatl@Mac-11.lan 55371c0d1106a8f9
